35,2,1,talk,Mio,,The transport receipts are shocking. It was 38% of the total last time we went far. That is way too high.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,I found something worrying. The seniors say mixing only happens when we sleep together. And the attendance sheets show a fifth of us never came.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I checked the canteen. It is closed. Last year, the duty pair lost two hours a day cooking. I will not do that again.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,I looked at the hall timetable. It is split into early mornings and late evenings. That is terrible for sleep.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"I found the accounts. The inland clubs slept eight to a room. The prefecture rate is 1,100 yen per bed. That is a fixed, low cost.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, if the rate is fixed at 1,100 yen, that solves my worry about uneven side spending. Everyone pays the same for the bed.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, if we sleep in the same place, the seniors say the year-groups actually mix. That is exactly what we need.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shizue, if we sleep together, we still need to eat. If the canteen is closed, we are back to cooking duty.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, if we are in the hall, the split schedule means we are awake at 5 AM. I cannot train on that.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, the 1,100 yen rate includes the hall. If we choose the public beds, we avoid the variable costs of a private hotel.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,I think the public beds are the only way to keep the fee flat. The transport cost is the only variable left.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. The social benefit of sleeping together is worth the effort. We need to make sure the evenings are structured.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I am still worried about the cooking. If we choose the public beds, we need to confirm if they provide meals.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I am worried about the sleep quality. If the beds are old, the split schedule will make it worse.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"The accounts show the inland clubs had no hidden fees. The 1,100 yen is the total. That is the safest financial option.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"Let's go with the public beds. It is fair, it is cheap, and it encourages mixing.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I support that. It is the best way to bring the club back together.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will support it if we can confirm the meal situation. I will not take on cooking duty again.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,I will support it if the beds are decent. I need to know we can actually sleep.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I support it. The financial risk is minimal. The cost is fixed and transparent.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
